    <constraint source="FR-21 / project">The simplification-banner dismissal MUST persist for the session (sessionStorage-backed) — an × closes it and it does not reappear on re-render within the session.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-021 / NFR-10">All three surfaces are Fluent UI v9 and MUST render correctly in dark mode (theme tokens; no hard-coded colors).</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-028 / NFR-10">No new network calls; any client fetch uses `@spaarke/auth`.</constraint>
    <constraint source="ADR-038 / NFR-06">Client component/unit tests only; no `Mock&lt;HttpMessageHandler&gt;`, no DI-registration/ctor-null tests. Tests exercise real render/scroll/dismiss behavior.</constraint>
  </constraints>

